Package: pulzr-zwave
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Provides: pulzr-cap-zwave
Depends: pulzr-edge=@VERSION@
Description: Z-Wave networks on the gateway's Z-Wave controllers, on pulzr-edge.
 A Serial API controller per radio, set up, paired (S2 and SmartStart) and
 backed up from Pulzar Net (docs/radio-modules.md).
